          "content": {
            "size": 19854,
            "compression": 14792,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"lastUpdatedTime\":\"2026-02-18T00:40:05.2973631Z\",\"zones\":[{\"zoneName\":\"WebInlinePromos\",\"zoneType\":\"\",\"promotions\":[{\"promotionId\":832642,\"publicPromotionId\":\"Z1W5Y2\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-17T12:00:00.0000000Z\",\"expirationDate\":\"2026-02-22T04:59:00.0000000Z\",\"productName\":\"Sportsbook\",\"category\":\"Profit Boost\",\"merchandisingData\":{\"promotionHeadline\":\"The Genesis Invitational Top Finish Parlay Boost\",\"promotionDescription\":\"Get a 20% Boost on The Genesis Invitational \\\"Top X Finish\\\" Parlays!\",\"promotionImage\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20260216T080621_OSB_GOLF_3.0%20STQ%20Template_CRM-Promos_Static_240x200_PromoPage_Course_3%20(4).webp\",\"promotionBackgroundImage\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20240905T021556_OSB_CFB_Tier1_CRM_PROMO_OfferCard_LeftAligned_686x384_GameOfTheWeek.png\",\"autoRefreshBackgroundImage\":false,\"promotionDetailsImage\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20260216T080624_OSB_GOLF_3.0%20STQ%20Template_CRM-Promos_Static_900x300_PromoPageTerms_Course_3%20(3).webp\",\"terms\":\"**FULL TERMS AND CONDITIONS**\\n\\nThank you for choosing to participate in this promotion (the “Promotion”) being offered by DraftKings. By entering or participating in the Promotion you hereby agree to be bound by these Promotion terms (the “Promotion Terms”).  If you do not wish to be bound by the Promotion Terms, please do not enter or participate in the Promotion.  If you have any questions regarding the Promotion or the Promotion Terms, or wish to cancel your participation in this Promotion, please contact support@draftkings.com for more information.\\n\\n**PROMOTION REQUIREMENTS AND ELIGIBILITY**\\n\\nThe promotional offer is valid between 2/17/2026 at 7:00 AM Eastern Time (ET) and 2/21/2026 at 11:59 PM ET (the “Promotional Period”). Must be physically located in AZ, CO, CT, DC, IA, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA (select parishes), MA, MD, ME, MI, MO, NC, NH, NJ, NY, OH, OR, PA, TN, VA, VT, WY or WV, or CA-ONT (each an “Eligible Jurisdiction” or, collectively, the “Eligible Jurisdictions”). Must be 21+ years of age or older (18+ if in DC/KY/NH/WY) (19+ if in CA-ONT). Any customer who is found to be ineligible to play on DraftKings (i.e., by way of self-exclusion from gambling, restriction due to employment, or otherwise) may not participate in this Promotion and immediately forfeits any bonus rewards which have been awarded under this Promotion.\\n\\nIn addition to the eligibility requirements set forth above and in the DraftKings Terms of Use, to participate in the Promotion, customers must (1) be a registered DraftKings Sportsbook customer with an active account; (2) receive an offer to participate in this Promotion; and (3) opt-in by clicking on the appropriate link or button within the Promotional Period. The offer is only for the intended recipient - customers who receive this offer via an email forward, screenshot, or other means shall not be eligible.\\n\\n**PROFIT BOOST REDEMPTION**\\n\\nUpon completion of the promotion requirements, eligible customers will be awarded one (1) 20% Profit Boost Token (the \\\"Token\\\"). Token will boost Qualifying Bet profit 20%. Token valid only on 3+ leg parlay of \\\"Top X Finish\\\" markets for The Genesis Invitational (\\\"Winner, Top 5, Top 10, Top 20, Top 30, Top 40 with or without including ties\\\") bets (the “Qualifying Bet”). Req. total minimum odds of +200. All other bet types are excluded from this Promotion. Cashed-out bets and voided bets will void this Promotion. Bets placed with bonus rewards (including but not limited to Bonus Bets, Odds Boosts/Surges, etc.) are not valid. Token expires at 11:59PM ET on 2/21/2026. Qualifying Bet must be placed using cash from your cash balance or DK Dollars. Maximum $20 Qualifying Bet.\\n\\n**PROFIT BOOST LIMITATIONS**\\n\\nProfit Boost Tokens are single-use and have no cash value. Token must be applied BEFORE placing bet. Profit boost is calculated on and only applies to net winnings (total payout less Qualifying Bet amount). Subject to any maximum bet limitations, there are no restrictions on the funds a customer will receive if their bet wins. Profit Boosts may not be combined with other bonus rewards and may not be eligible for use on all promotions and/or betting markets.\\n\\n**GENERAL TERMS**\\n\\nLimit one (1) redemption per customer. Customers must opt-in to this Promotion each time it is offered. Opting-in to this Promotion during a single day is only valid during that day and does not opt the customer into future periods. See DraftKings Sportsbook Terms of Use for information and limitations on wagering. Each customer will be notified when they have received an award by (1) a bell notification (this is a notification that displays as a bell icon on the home page of the DraftKings Sportsbook app and website that can be clicked on to view short confirmation copy and terms) and/or (2) an automatically triggered email if the customer successfully entered the promotion and completed the promotion requirements. Whether a customer has committed abuse of this Promotion, violated the Promotion Terms or DraftKings Terms of Use, will be determined by DraftKings in its sole discretion, for any reason or no reason at all.  Should you wish to cancel your participation in this promotion at any time, please contact customer experience at sportsbook@draftkings.com. Upon cancellation, you may withdraw any remaining funds deposited in connection with this promotion subject to DraftKings Terms of Use. Any wager placed on DraftKings Sportsbook in connection with the promotion cannot be rescinded once it has been placed. However, any applicable bonus rewards in your account shall be void, subject to forfeiture, and may not be transferred or withdrawn. All promotions are subject to the DraftKings Terms of Use and Privacy Policy. By accepting any bonus rewards, registered customers agree to abide by the terms and conditions of this Promotion. Promotional offer is subject to regulatory approval. Void where prohibited by law. DraftKings account holders are responsible for any and all local, state, or federal taxes. DraftKings is not liable for computer or program malfunctions, nor for errors in bonus rewards. DraftKings reserves the right to exclude or remove certain customers from this Promotion, as well as the right to withhold bonus rewards if you have violated or attempted to violate the Promotion Terms or DraftKings Terms of Use, including but not limited to sharing account credentials with other individuals, placing wagers on behalf of other individuals, circumventing DraftKings age and location verification procedures, and abusing the DraftKings Platform, the Services, or any bonuses, the refer-a-friend program, or any other offers or promotions, including this Promotion, in any way.\\n\\nIf physically located in PA, this Promotion will comply with subsection §813.3 regarding cancellation in this Promotion by a customer. If in NY, if a customer is dissatisfied with any resolution between the customer and DraftKings, the customer may then submit an inquiry with the New York State Gaming Commission.\\n\\nSee DraftKings Terms of Use for information on eligibility for creating, using, and funding an interactive gaming account. DraftKings reserves the right to suspend, modify, and/or cancel this Promotion for any reason in its sole discretion. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem, help is available. Call 1-800-GAMBLER.\",\"termsHighlights\":\"Details:\\n1. The Genesis Invitational 2026\\n2. Following Opt-In, you'll be issued with one (1) single-use 20% Profit Boost token on any 3+ leg parlay of \\\"Top X Finish\\\" markets. \\\"Winner, Top 5, Top 10, Top 20, Top 30, Top 40 with or without including ties\\\". (Under Outrights)\\n3. Profit Boost: 20%\\n4. Max bet: $20\\n5. Minimum 3 legs required\\n6. Minimum total bet odds of +200 or longer apply (ex. +250, +600)\\n7. One Profit Boost Token per customer for the Promotional Period\\n8. Boost Token expires Saturday, 2/21 at 11:59 PM ET\\n9. Wagering on this promotion must use funds from your cash balance or DK Dollars to qualify\\n10. Must be 21+, unless otherwise stated, and located in AZ, CO, CT, DC (18+), IA, IL, IN, KS, KY (18+), LA, MA, MD, ME, MI, MO, NC, NH (18+), NJ, NY, OH, ONT (19+), OR, PA, TN, VA, VT, WV, or WY (18+)\\nIneligible Bets:\\n- Excludes SGPx, progressive parlays, odds boosts, cash out bets, and voided bets\\n- Wagers with legs on non-eligible events\",\"displayToLoggedOutUsers\":false,\"additionalDetail\":\"MAX BET: $20\",\"useInformedOptIn\":false,\"inlineDetails\":{\"eventGroupId\":\"89343\",\"displayGroupId\":\"12\",\"promotionSubHeadline\":\"Get a 20% Boost on The Genesis Invitational \\\"Top X Finish\\\" Parlays!\"},\"isCarouselCtaButtonDisabled\":false,\"imageCardHasTerms\":true,\"promotionBackgroundImageHD\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20260216T080626_OSB_GOLF_3.0%20STQ%20Template_CRM-Promos_Static_686x384_OfferCard_Course_2.webp\"},\"userData\":{\"statusId\":6,\"promotionDetailsButton\":{\"text\":\"See Details\",\"nativeDetailedViewUrl\":\"/mf/rewardcenter?view=PromotionDetailView&promotionId=832642&action=terms&callingZone=WebInlinePromos\"},\"promotionActionButton\":{\"text\":\"Opt In\",\"actionUrl\":\"/api/promotions/v2/promotions/832642/optin?zoneName=WebInlinePromos\"},\"termsViewActionButton\":{\"text\":\"Opt In\",\"actionUrl\":\"/api/promotions/v2/promotions/832642/optin?zoneName=WebInlinePromos\"}},\"promotionalContent\":[{\"contentType\":\"BonusOffer\",\"data\":{\"isOptedIn\":false,\"bonusPackage\":{\"bonusPackageTypeId\":1,\"promotionBonuses\":[{\"bonusId\":1586508,\"payoutTypeId\":16,\"payoutValue\":0,\"metadata\":{\"SBTechBonusType\":\"BetBoost\",\"SBTechBonusId\":\"172511\",\"SBTechBonusCalculationType\":\"percentOfNetProfit\",\"SBTechExternalBonusName\":\"Genesis Invitational 20% Parlay Boost\"},\"externalId\":\"172511\",\"isRelative\":false,\"payoutValuePercent\":100}]},\"awardedBonuses\":[],\"hasUserActions\":false},\"views\":[]}],\"isOptInPromotion\":true,\"promotionTags\":[],\"promotionMetadata\":{},\"language\":\"en\"},{\"promotionId\":833246,\"publicPromotionId\":\"J561VV\",\"startDate\":\"2026-02-17T17:29:00.0000000Z\",\"expirationDate\":\"2026-02-19T17:30:00.0000000Z\",\"productName\":\"Sportsbook\",\"category\":\"Odds Surge\",\"merchandisingData\":{\"promotionHeadline\":\"First Round Leader +400 Odds Surge\",\"promotionDescription\":\"Get a +400 Odds Surge for the First Round Leader in The Genesis Invitational!\",\"promotionImage\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20260217T044033_OSB_GOLF_3.0%20STQ%20Template_CRM-Promos_Static_240x200_PromoPage_Course_3.webp\",\"promotionBackgroundImage\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20240905T021556_OSB_CFB_Tier1_CRM_PROMO_OfferCard_LeftAligned_686x384_GameOfTheWeek.png\",\"autoRefreshBackgroundImage\":false,\"promotionDetailsImage\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20260217T044035_OSB_GOLF_3.0%20STQ%20Template_CRM-Promos_Static_900x300_PromoPageTerms_Course_3.webp\",\"terms\":\"Thank you for choosing to participate in this promotion (the “Promotion”) being offered by DraftKings. By entering or participating in the Promotion you hereby agree to be bound by these Promotion terms (the “Promotion Terms”). If you do not wish to be bound by the Promotion Terms, please do not enter or participate in the Promotion. If you have any questions regarding the Promotion or the Promotion Terms, or wish to cancel your participation in this Promotion, please contact support@draftkings.com for more information.\\n\\n**PROMOTION REQUIREMENTS AND ELIGIBILITY**\\n\\nThe promotional offer is valid between 02/17/2026 at 11:30 AM Eastern Time (ET) and the beginning of The Genesis Invitational 2026 (the “Promotional Period”). Must be physically located in AZ, CO, CT, DC, IA, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA (select parishes), MA, MD, ME, MI, MO, NC, NH, NJ, NY, OH, OR, PA, TN, VA, VT, WA, WV or WY, or CA-ONT (each an “Eligible Jurisdiction” or, collectively, the “Eligible Jurisdictions”). Must be 21+ years of age or older (18+ if in DC/KY/NH/WY) (19+ if in CA-ONT). Any customer who is found to be ineligible to play on DraftKings (i.e., by way of self-exclusion from gambling, restriction due to employment, or otherwise) may not participate in this Promotion and immediately forfeits any bonus rewards which have been awarded under this Promotion.\\n\\nIn addition to the eligibility requirements set forth above and in the DraftKings Terms of Use, to participate in the Promotion, customers must (1) be a registered DraftKings Sportsbook customer with an active account; (2) receive an offer to participate in this Promotion; and (3) if required, opt-in by clicking the appropriate link/button within the Promotional Period.\\n\\n**ODDS SURGE REDEMPTION**\\n\\nUpon completion of the promotion requirements, eligible customers will be awarded one (1) +400 Odds Surge Token (the \\\"Token\\\"). Token will boost Qualifying Bet odds by +400. Tokens valid only for a 'First Round Leader' bet on The Genesis Invitational (the “Qualifying Bet”). All other bet types are excluded from this Promotion. Maximum $20 Qualifying Bet. Cashed-out bets and voided bets will void this Promotion. Bets placed with bonus rewards (including but not limited to Bonus Bets, Odds Boosts, Profit Boosts, etc.) are not valid. Qualifying Bet must be placed using cash from your cash balance and/or DK Dollars.\\n\\n**ODDS SURGE LIMITATIONS**\\n\\nOdds Surge tokens are single-use and have no cash value. Odds Surge will increase any Qualifying Bet markets from their current odds by the specified Odds Surge (ex. a +200 odds surge means +100 odds becomes +300 odds). Customers must select the surge in their betslip BEFORE placing a Qualifying Bet. There are no restrictions on the funds a customer will receive if their bet wins. Paid bets settled using the \\\"Cash Out\\\" feature will void the promotion. Odds Surges may not be combined with other bonus rewards and may not be eligible for use on all promotions and/or betting markets. Token expires at the start of The Genesis Invitational on 02/19/2026.\\n\\n**GENERAL TERMS**\\n\\nLimit one (1) redemption per customer. Reward substitutions or changes will be made in DraftKings's sole discretion. See DraftKings Sportsbook Terms of Use for information and limitations on wagering. Each customer will be notified when they have received an award by (1) a bell notification (this is a notification that displays as a bell icon on the home page of the DraftKings Sportsbook app and website that can be clicked on to view short confirmation copy and terms) and/or (2) an automatically triggered email if the customer successfully entered the promotion and completed the promotion requirements. Whether a customer has committed abuse of this Promotion, violated the Promotion Terms or DraftKings Terms of Use, will be determined by DraftKings in its sole discretion, for any reason or no reason at all. Should you wish to cancel your participation in this promotion at any time, please contact customer experience at sportsbook@draftkings.com. Upon cancellation, you may withdraw any remaining funds deposited in connection with this promotion subject to DraftKings Terms of Use. Any wager placed on DraftKings Sportsbook in connection with the promotion cannot be rescinded once it has been placed. However, any applicable bonus rewards in your account shall be void, subject to forfeiture, and may not be transferred or withdrawn. All promotions are subject to the DraftKings Terms of Use and Privacy Policy. By accepting any bonus rewards, registered customers agree to abide by the terms and conditions of this Promotion. Promotional offer is subject to regulatory approval. Void where prohibited by law. DraftKings account holders are responsible for any and all local, state, or federal taxes. DraftKings is not liable for computer or program malfunctions, nor for errors in bonus rewards. DraftKings reserves the right to exclude or remove certain customers from this Promotion, as well as the right to withhold bonus rewards if you have violated or attempted to violate the Promotion Terms or DraftKings Terms of Use, including but not limited to sharing account credentials with other individuals, placing wagers on behalf of other individuals, circumventing DraftKings age and location verification procedures, betting both sides of a game or matchup to complete play-through or promotion requirements, and abusing the DraftKings Platform, the Services, or any bonuses, the refer-a-friend program, or any other offers or promotions, including this Promotion, in any way.\\n\\nIf physically located in PA, this Promotion will comply with subsection §813.3 regarding cancellation in this Promotion by a customer. If in NY, if a customer is dissatisfied with any resolution between the customer and DraftKings, the customer may then submit an inquiry with the New York State Gaming Commission.\\n\\nSee DraftKings Terms of Use for information on eligibility for creating, using, and funding an interactive gaming account. DraftKings reserves the right to suspend, modify, and/or cancel this Promotion for any reason in its sole discretion. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem, help is available, Call 1-800-GAMBLER. In Canada: Concerned about your Gambling? Call ConnexOntario 1-866-531-2600.\",\"termsHighlights\":\"Details:\\n1. The Genesis Invitational 2026\\n2. Following Opt-In, you'll be issued with one (1) single-use +400 Odds Surge to use on any First Round Leader bet for The Genesis Invitational\\n3. You must select the boost in your betslip before placing the bet to apply the boosted price (ex. +1100 becomes +1500, +2250 becomes +2650)\\n4. Max Bet: $20\\n5. Odds Surge token expires at the start of The Genesis Invitational on Thursday 2/19\\n6. Wagering on this promotion must use funds from your cash balance or DK Dollars to qualify\\n7. One qualifying Odds Surge Token per customer during the promotional period.\\n8. Must be 21+, unless otherwise stated, and physically located in AZ, CO, CT, DC (18+), IA, IL, IN, KS, KY (18+), LA, MA, MD, ME, MI, MO, NC, NH (18+), NJ, NY, OH, ONT (19+), OR, PA, TN, VA, VT, WV, or WY (18+)\\n\\nIneligible Bets:\\nExcludes Parlays, SGP bets, SGPx bets, odds boosts, cash out bets and voided bets\\nWagers with legs on non-eligible games\",\"displayToLoggedOutUsers\":false,\"additionalDetail\":\"MAX BET: $20\",\"useInformedOptIn\":false,\"inlineDetails\":{\"eventGroupId\":\"89343\",\"displayGroupId\":\"12\",\"promotionSubHeadline\":\"Get a +400 Odds Surge for First Round Leader in The Genesis Invitational!\"},\"isCarouselCtaButtonDisabled\":false,\"imageCardHasTerms\":true,\"promotionBackgroundImageHD\":\"https://sportsbook.draftkings.com/static/promos/images/20260217T062759_OSB_GOLF_3.0%20STQ%20Template_CRM-Promos_Static_686x384_OfferCard_Course_2%20(2).webp\"},\"userData\":{\"statusId\":6,\"promotionDetailsButton\":{\"text\":\"See Details\",\"nativeDetailedViewUrl\":\"/mf/rewardcenter?view=PromotionDetailView&promotionId=833246&action=terms&callingZone=WebInlinePromos\"},\"promotionActionButton\":{\"text\":\"Opt In\",\"actionUrl\":\"/api/promotions/v2/promotions/833246/optin?zoneName=WebInlinePromos\"},\"termsViewActionButton\":{\"text\":\"Opt In\",\"actionUrl\":\"/api/promotions/v2/promotions/833246/optin?zoneName=WebInlinePromos\"}},\"promotionalContent\":[{\"contentType\":\"BonusOffer\",\"data\":{\"isOptedIn\":false,\"bonusPackage\":{\"bonusPackageTypeId\":1,\"promotionBonuses\":[{\"bonusId\":1588488,\"payoutTypeId\":16,\"payoutValue\":0,\"metadata\":{\"SBTechBonusType\":\"BetBoost\",\"SBTechBonusId\":\"172874\",\"SBTechBonusCalculationType\":\"fixedOddsExtension\",\"SBTechExternalBonusName\":\"First Round Leader +400 Odds Surge\"},\"externalId\":\"172874\",\"isRelative\":false,\"payoutValuePercent\":100}]},\"awardedBonuses\":[],\"hasUserActions\":false},\"views\":[]}],\"isOptInPromotion\":true,\"promotionTags\":[],\"promotionMetadata\":{},\"language\":\"en\"}],\"zoneIdentifierId\":\"F5NVDUXData\"}]}"
